; A commodity-less balance assignment ("= 0") on an account holding two
; commodities cannot be expressed as one posting amount, so parsing fails
; with the balance conversion error.

2024/01/01 Two commodities
    Assets:Mixed               10 AAPL
    Assets:Mixed               5 EUR
    Assets:Cash

2024/01/02 Zero everything
    Assets:Mixed               = 0
    Equity:Adjustments

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 11:
While parsing posting:
  Assets:Mixed               = 0
                               ^
Error: Cannot convert a balance with multiple commodities to an amount
end test
